  "description": "ML.NET estimator and transformer for the multilingual-e5-small text embedder (Starlings.Models.E5): a text column to a fixed-size Vector<Single, 384> embedding column and an optional token-count column, with one inference per row however many getters are requested, explicit e5 prefixes and optional look-ahead batching. Pipeline composition only: saving the transformer is unsupported (it throws); the model is resolved from its asset lock at run time. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
